//     mem        70,607 of     16,500,000    0.43%
//
// against mainnet protocol parameters at epoch 650. `scripts/record-groth16-budget.sh`
// re-measures and writes vectors/budget.json, which docs/ZEROJ-REVIEW.md is tested against. CPU is the binding
// constraint and memory is not close to one — so a Groth16 proof can be
// verified on Cardano mainnet inside a transaction that still has room for the
// validator logic around it. That is the number that decides whether any of
// this is usable, and it is worth re-reading when the parameters change.

